# Carbon Trail Branding Rules

- Use CSS variables from `app/globals.css` as the source of truth.
- Do not introduce ad-hoc hex colors in components.
- Prefer semantic tokens like `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, and `border-border`.

## Palette

- `--bg-base`: `#0C0C0C`
- `--surface`: `#1A1A1A`
- `--surface-alt`: `#252525`
- `--border-strong`: `#2E2E2E`
- `--accent`: `#3A5A40`
- `--accent-hover`: `#4E7A56`
- `--text-primary`: `#E8E0D0`
- `--text-secondary`: `#A8A090`
- `--text-muted`: `#5A5248`
- `--text-accent`: `#90C0A0`
- `--text-inverse`: `#0C0C0C`

## Typography

- UI + headings use Space Grotesk (`font-sans`).
- Wordmark, code blocks, and small labels use JetBrains Mono (`font-mono` or `.font-wordmark`).
- Type scale:
  - Display `72px / 900`
  - H1 `48px / 800`
  - H2 `32px / 700`
  - H3 `20px / 500`
  - Body `16px / 300`
  - Eyebrow `11px / 200` with `5px` letter spacing
